<!--
  WhisperOfSol — String resources (v3.0.0, 2026-10-09)

  Naming convention: <screen>_<purpose> or <category>_<purpose>
  Examples: action_copy, screen_title_inbox, error_connect_failed

  Languages: en (default) / zh-Hans (简体中文) / zh-Hant (繁體中文) / ja (日本語)
  All translations live in:
    values-zh-rCN/strings.xml
    values-zh-rTW/strings.xml
    values-ja/strings.xml

  Formatting:
    - Use %1$s / %1$d / %1%.4f for positional args
    - Technical terms (X25519, AES-GCM, PDA, Seed Vault, etc.) stay in English
    - Brand names (Whisper of Sol, Seeker, Solana) do not translate
    - Lottery tier names (Consolation, Small, Medium, Large, Mystery Jackpot) are
      translated but English in parentheses is OK for tier_xxx_label
-->
